The geometric examples realize all four possibilities. The non-K\"ahler entries below follow from \cref{cor:hopf-lower-mass,prop:lower-mass-balanced-metric,cor:both-mass-properties-fail}.
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{@{}l@{\qquad}l@{\qquad}l@{}}
Manifold & Domain $\mathcal D_h$ & Is $\rho_h$ complete?\\
\hline
K\"ahler manifold & $L^n$ & Yes\\
Hopf threefold & $L^n$ & No\\
Balanced elliptic quotient & $\mathcal D_h\subsetneq L^n$ & Yes\\
Product example & $\mathcal D_h\subsetneq L^n$ & No
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
